---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { suggestEventUrl } from '../lib/report.mjs';
---
<BaseLayout title="About — doon.today" description="What doon.today is, and how to report a mistake or a missing event.">
  <section class="simple-page prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT</p>
    <h1>A calendar for Doon.</h1>
    <p>Doon.today collects public event information from ticketing platforms, organizers and local community sources, then filters it for Dehradun relevance.</p>
    <p>The project is intentionally text-first and calendar-first. It is not a ticket marketplace and does not require an account.</p>
    <p>Events retain source provenance and freshness metadata so you can verify details before making plans.</p>

    <h2>Spot a mistake, or a missing event?</h2>
    <p>Every event page has a "Report a problem" link that opens a prefilled issue on GitHub. To suggest an event we have missed, <a href={suggestEventUrl()}>open an issue</a>. There is no email address for this yet.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
